1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:04,336
Owner ke liye pehla lesson — Dashboard ke chaar KPI cards ka matlab.

2
00:00:04,336 --> 00:00:08,226
Pehla card, Total Sales — is FY mein aapki poori sales value.

3
00:00:08,226 --> 00:00:12,881
Neeche chhote akshar mein compare hai — pichhle FY se kitna zyada ya kam.

4
00:00:12,881 --> 00:00:17,217
Doosra card, Total Orders — kitne unique sales vouchers banaye gaye.

5
00:00:17,217 --> 00:00:21,553
Teesra card, Outstanding Amount — customers ne kitna paisa dena hai.

6
00:00:21,553 --> 00:00:24,742
Yeh number jitna kam ho, utna hi business healthy.

7
00:00:24,742 --> 00:00:29,907
Chautha card, Beat Coverage — kitne percent customers ko is week visit kiya gaya.

8
00:00:29,907 --> 00:00:34,498
Agar Beat Coverage 60 percent se kam hai, toh sales team ko push kariye.

9
00:00:34,498 --> 00:00:37,687
In chaar numbers ko har subah phone pe dekh lijiye

10
00:00:37,687 --> 00:00:41,832
30 second mein pata chal jaayega ki business kaisa chal raha hai.
